<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Syntactic Blind Spots: How Misalignment Leads to LLMs’ Mathematical Errors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Cognitive Psychology: Rational Errors</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
