<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Cognitive Psychology: Rational Errors</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To contextualize our findings within broader theories of reasoning failure, we draw on insights from cognitive psychology and mathematical pedagogy. Specifically, we reference the work of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ben-Zeev (1998)</a></cite>, who frames many student errors in mathematics not as random mistakes, but as <span id="A1.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">rational errors</span>. systematic overgeneralizations of otherwise valid strategies.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F9" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F9.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="69.61" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 228.35 69.61" width="228.35"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,69.61) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(113.22,0) translate(0,40.57)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -105.29 14.94)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.34em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="9.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="53.11"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M -102.36 7.87 C -102.36 15.55 -82.68 15.55 -82.68 8.51"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.32pt" transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 -82.68 8.51)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -1.66 2.21 C -1.52 1.38 0 0.14 0.42 0 C 0 -0.14 -1.52 -1.38 -1.66 -2.21"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -86.14 9.32)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.92" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.2" class="ltx_text">1</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -105.82 1.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--lt