<span id="A1.T5.2.1.10.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Jerome has 4 friends visiting him, and the first friend rang the doorbell 20 times before Jerome opened it. The second friend rang the doorbell 1/4 times more than the first friend, the third friend rang it 10 times more than the fourth friend, and the fourth friend rang it 60 times. How many times did the doorbell ring in total?</span>
</span></td>
