<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Jam has three boxes full of pencils and 2 loose pencils which give a total of 26 pencils. If her sister, Meg, has 46 pencils, how many boxes do Jam and Meg need to store all their pencils?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.11.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Jam has three boxes of pencils and 2 loose pencils, which together total 26 pencils. Her sister, Meg, has 46 pencils. How many boxes do Jam and Meg need to store all their pencils?</span>
